\section{Project Overview}
MorningBrief.AI is a data-driven personal assistant designed to synthesize disparate data points into a coherent daily narrative. The architecture focuses on \textbf{Contextual Awareness} and \textbf{Efficiency}.

\textbf{Database Strategy} \\
We utilize \textbf{Supabase (PostgreSQL)} to maintain relational integrity between user preferences and generated content. This ensures that every briefing is highly personalized and contextually accurate based on stored user history.

\textbf{Performance \& Caching} \\
To optimize load times and API overhead, an \textbf{API Caching Layer} is implemented. High-frequency data such as weather and stock trends are cached for 60 minutes, ensuring data freshness while providing near-instant response times.

